**The agent can keep"},{"id":"p5s2","text":" working without treating a lossy summary as the source of truth.**"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"中文 · User guide · Architecture · Research archive"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"*A real render from a live session. The Sidebar reads the same status projection as `/context status"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"` and never enters the model prompt — unknown values show as `—`, never as a fabricated zero.*"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## The problem"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Long-running agents accumulate a lot of useful history:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- requirements and later revisions;
- failed approaches and why they failed;
- tool outputs;
- imple"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"mentation decisions;
- temporary constraints;
- facts that may not matter again for hundreds of turn"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"ntation decisions;
- temporary constraints;
- facts that may not matter again for hundreds of turns."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Eventually that history has to leave the active prompt."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"The usual answer is to summarize it."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"That helps with context size, but it creates a second problem:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"A compressed narrative can be useful, but it is a poor canonical record. Details
can disappear, an o"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"ld value can look current again, and a later agent may have no
way to recover the exact source that "},{"id":"p15s3","text":"k current again, and a later agent may have no
way to recover the exact source that was folded away."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"**Epistemic Fold changes the contract.**"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"The active prompt gets smaller. The original history does not vanish."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Why this is different from "just summarize it""},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| | ordinary lossy compaction | Epistemic Fold |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| **source of truth** | compressed narrative often becomes the only visible representation | DSH ses"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"sion + exact Fold Bundle remain canonical |
| **old detail** | may be unrecoverable | exact archived"},{"id":"p21s3","text":" messages are searchable and pageable |
| **repeated compaction** | can repeatedly rewrite previous "},{"id":"p21s4","text":"summaries | normal folds advance a monotonic **Fold Frontier** |
| **current state** | mostly implic"},{"id":"p21s5","text":"it in prose | deterministic state can be represented separately from narrative |
| **cache behavior*"},{"id":"p21s6","text":"* | rewriting early context can churn the prefix | leaf folds keep the frozen prefix stable; root re"},{"id":"p21s7","text":"bases are rare |
| **observability** | usually opaque | `/context status` + Sidebar show pressure, f"},{"id":"p21s8","text":"olds, archive, recall and usage |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"EF is not trying to build the world's smartest summarizer."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"It is trying to make **lossy summarization non-authoritative**."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## A 30-second tour"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"### 1. Pick the trade-off you want"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"| mode | idea |"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"| **Economy** | keep the hot context lean; recover older detail on demand |
| **Balanced** | keep a "},{"id":"p28s2","text":"larger verbatim recent tail |
| **Quality** | Balanced + semantic rationale checkpoints |"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"The tiers use the same engine. Each rung adds one explicit retention / redundancy
lever, so the trad"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"e-off is inspectable rather than hidden behind three unrelated
implementations."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"`legacy` remains the frozen EF compatibility baseline.
`basic` makes EF stand aside and delegates to"},{"id":"p30s2","text":" the vendored Basic backend."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"### 2. Watch what the runtime is doing"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Typical fields:"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"The browser Sidebar reads the same status model."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"**The status UI is outside model history.** Looking at your compression state
does not consume the c"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"ontext it is reporting on."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"### 3. Let the agent recover what left the prompt"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"When DSH provides a ToolRuntime, EF registers:"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"- `context_search` — locate relevant folded history and bounded verbatim excerpts;
- `context_recall"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"` — retrieve a checkpoint view or exact archived messages."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"So "not currently in the prompt" does not mean "gone"."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"## How folding works"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"A normal **Leaf Fold** only touches the open trajectory after the Fold Frontier:"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"## What is actually proven today?"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"EF deliberately separates measured behavior from product hypotheses."},{"id":"p47s1","text":"**Established on the current implementation**"},{"id":"p48s1","text":"- exact archive-before-loss and hash-verified Fold Bundles;
- exact bounded recall of folded history"},{"id":"p48s2","text":";
- monotonic Fold Frontier behavior;
- production Leaf / Root fold transaction paths;
- retrieval o"},{"id":"p48s3","text":"rdering and temporal supersession safeguards;
- real DSH plugin mounting, preset substitution, runti"},{"id":"p48s4","text":"me commands and Sidebar;
- an Economy path that works without a per-fold semantic-model call."},{"id":"p49s1","text":"**Still open**"},{"id":"p50s1","text":"- whether **Balanced** or **Quality** produces a reliable long-horizon steadiness
advantage over Eco"},{"id":"p50s2","text":"nomy;
- whether one mode is universally cheaper after real provider cache behavior,
retries, tool us"},{"id":"p50s3","text":"e and route pricing are included;
- full external-benchmark ranking across modes."},{"id":"p51s1","text":"That distinction is intentional. EF has repeatedly found instrumentation bugs by
running the system "},{"id":"p51s2","text":"for real, and the project keeps those corrections instead of
turning a null result into a marketing "},{"id":"p51s3","text":"al, and the project keeps those corrections instead of
turning a null result into a marketing claim."},{"id":"p52s1","text":"The full evidence trail lives in docs/README.md."},{"id":"p53s1","text":"## What EF does *not* try to be"},{"id":"p54s1","text":"Epistemic Fold is not:"},{"id":"p55s1","text":"- a vector database;
