- a learned compression planner;
- a semant"},{"id":"p55s2","text":"ic dependency graph;
- a multi-level "summary of summaries" hierarchy;
- a replacement for DSH goals"},{"id":"p55s3","text":", plans, todos, or project instructions."},{"id":"p56s1","text":"Those boundaries are deliberate."},{"id":"p57s1","text":"EF owns the **folding contract**. Existing DSH subsystems keep owning the state
